narrator: Friday 13\:00 - Omega Seaside, Blue's bedroom
narrator: *seagull sounds and distant city noise leak through a small bedroom window*
narrator: *aggressive keyboard clicking is audible from the right side of the room*
# news , weather, lab tests shortly
narrator: *news broadcast is just beginning on a TV beside the window...*
news_host: "Good friday afternoon Omega Seaside! "
news_host: "This is your host Sid McNamara, coming at you live from the KTVO HQ at Western Harbour Road! "
news_host: "Sadly, we are entering the weekend with heavy wind, rainfall, and possible thunderstorms. "
news_host: "The stormy weather-front is expected to hit the western shores of the island, at around 4PM local time. Small naval vessels are advised to return to shore before 3PM. "
news_host: "Before letting you go, I'll brief you with a public PSA\: "
news_host: "The white-coats at the North Point laboratory-district are performing some underground tests shortly, at around 13\:30 local time. "
news_host: "Be advised\: The tests might cause minor tremors in the ground, but rest assured - they are completely harmless. "
# explosion 
narrator: 30 minutes later...
narrator: *a minor tremor vibrates the floor beneath Blue's feet*
narrator: 5 minutes later...
narrator: *another tremor hits, causing a few pencils to drop from the desk*
blue: *Now slightly alerted, Blue pauses the zombie shooter for a moment, carefully feeling the floor and desk*
blue: *Continues gaming*
narrator: Just 3 minutes later...
narrator: *a third tremor hits, shaking the wooden three-story house violently*
narrator: *a blinding white light appears and lights up the whole bedroom*
blue: *pauses the game, trying to desperately put on sunglasses*
narrator: *few seconds later, a MASSIVE explosion blows the bedroom window wide open*
narrator: *the sunglasses are immediately blasted off of Blue's face by the pressure. Blue falls on the floor, taking cover in a fetal position*
# emergency broadcast
narrator: 2 Minutes later...
narrator: *TV schedule is interrupted by emergency live coverage of the accident*
news_host: "...rt of explosion has occured at the North Point laboratory-district. Law enforcement are actively evacuating personnel through the two massive citadel gates."
narrator: *Live video footage is shown from accident site close to citadel-gates*
news_host: "...people up there seem to be very hurt. On the right side of the video, a lady seems to be missing an arm - oh dear - I hope she gets help quickly.."
news_host: "...evacuation- hold on, I think we are seeing a some violence occuring close by... wait... is that a human? no... HOLY CRAP, we can CLEARLY see some sort of tall creatures attacking people within the gates!"
news_host: "I have to stress that all citizens on the island are strongly advised to stay inside, lock doors, and await for further information."
# marvin text message
narrator: *Blue's phone vibrates on the floor next to him*
marvin: text message\: "dude are you seeing the news, literally wtf. shit is fucking crazy downtown. bro we gotta meet-up or smthng. can i come to ur house?"
blue: *responds*\: "I really don't think it's a good idea man. My window blew wide open from the blast."
# screams outside
narrator: *suddenly, painful screams of a young girl echo through the window, originating from somewhere close by*
blue: *a sense of responsibility takes over, and Blue storms outside to help the girl*
